@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <header>
        <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> 01 May 2026</p>
        <p><strong>Application Name:</strong> Personal Finance Tracker</p>
    </header>

    <main>
        <p>This application was developed strictly as part of an <strong>educational project and demonstration activity</strong>. It is intended solely for evaluation and testing by designated reviewers, including prospective employers, evaluators, and project collaborators.</p>

        <hr>

        <section>
            <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>Because this is a demonstration environment, we strongly advise users <strong>not to submit real, sensitive personal or financial information</strong> (such as actual bank account numbers, passwords, or Social Security numbers).</p>
            
            <p>Depending on how you interact with the app, we may collect or store:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Account Credentials:</strong> Dummy or test login details created for evaluation purposes.</li>
                <li><strong>Sample Financial Data:</strong> Mock transaction entries, balance amounts, or budget categories entered during testing.</li>
                <li><strong>Usage &amp; Technical Data:</strong> Basic error log data.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>2. How Your Information Is Used</h2>
            <p>Any data entered into this application is used exclusively to:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Demonstrate the features, user interface, and functional capabilities of the software.</li>
                <li>Test system performance, data validation, and application workflows.</li>
                <li>Provide evaluators and reviewers with an interactive user experience.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>We do <strong>not</strong> sell, rent, monetize, or share any submitted data with third parties or external marketing agencies.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>3. Data Storage &amp; Security</h2>
            <p>While standard security measures are implemented to protect the application, this software is hosted in an <strong>educational and testing environment</strong>. It is not designed to meet industrial-grade compliance standards for live production financial institutions.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>4. Data Retention &amp; Deletion</h2>
            <p>Test data, sample entries, and temporary accounts created during evaluations may be cleared, reset, or deleted periodically without prior notice.</p>
            <p>If you would like your dummy data removed immediately, please reach out using the contact details below. Please give us 5-10 business days to complete your request!</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>5. Contact Information</h2>
            <p>If you have any questions regarding this project or wish to request data removal, please contact the developer:</p>
